{{- /* The shared iTerm2 look for every Mac: the parent of "Default (Left Option as Alt)" (chezmoi-option-as-alt.json),
       so every Mac gets the same font, colours, bell, scrollback and trigger switch. chezmoi owns this file entirely
       and iTerm2 never rewrites it (no "Rewritable"), so nothing here flip-flops; a change made in iTerm2's Settings
       lands in the child profile and the iTerm2 after-script reports it. Its name sorts before
       chezmoi-option-as-alt.json because iTerm2 loads dynamic profiles in filename order and a parent must load
       first. Captured once from a Mac's "Default" profile (2026-11-19) with the picks in docs/superpowers/specs/
       2026-11-19-iterm2-same-on-every-mac-design.md; its own parent is each Mac's "Default", for keys not set here.
       The trigger switch is .chezmoidata/macos.toml. Cheatsheet: "Same iTerm2 on Every Mac". */ -}}
